    "Soothes Itchy Skin&Promotes a Shiny Coat: These flea chews for dogs address more than just pest defense by actively supporting skin repair and a healthier coat. Each dog flea chew delivers nutrients that help reduce the urge to scratch.Unlike basic flea chewables for dogs, this formula includes ingredients chosen to promote a soft, glossy appearance. This chewable flea and tick for dogs solution means a happier, more comfortable pup with a noticeably improved shine",
