    "All Breeds,Ages&Long Term Use:These flea and tick chews are suitable for all dogs in the family, regardless of breed or life stage, not necessary the need for multiple products. Each jar contains 200 flea and tick chews, delivering consistent daily support for multi-dog families or extended use.These reliable flea and tick chews make protecting every dog in your home simple and affordable"
